      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17667deab8bff1e4dead9ec4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时，外界对她的瞩目逐渐高涨到掀起\n社会现象的地步。接下来等待着富士奇石的，\n是她擅长的英里战“安田纪念”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b1f580544aaccd17f85e3e55a5fd0562f3bf2cfa96c78fe11a74c13d03b2e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
